      "For healthy veins, tired legs and long flights, the pharmacy pair is genuinely the right buy. Cochrane found flight socks cut symptomless DVT in airline passengers, and the air-travel trials used knee-length class 1 and 2 stockings at 14 to 30 mmHg.",
